    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41622" root="وثب" body-key="w">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُمْ يَتَوَاثَبُونَ عَلَى كَذَا</span></b>  <i>They leap,</i> or <i>rush,
together upon such a thing</i> [<i>in an evil,</i> or <i>injurious,</i> or <i>a contentious manner</i>]. (S, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كلب</span>.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّوَاثُبُ</span> is syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّكَالُبُ</span>. (S, K, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كلب</span>.)

